{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Fail closed when the host cannot advertise a local carrier**\n\nCore 2.4\u20132.6 never adds `xRayTraceId` to `InvocationInfo`, yet they remain accepted peers, so this branch always falls back to process-wide `_X_AMZN_TRACE_ID`. On Managed Instances that value can belong to another invocation, attributing spans and sampling decisions to the wrong execution. Require core 2.7+ for this release, or add a versioned capability signal and use the ARN-derived fallback when the host lacks it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-EQFs","finding_digest":"7e75ebf10d41d9647a91b0f12c7a68203adaac2222feb9b1ce37ec5b543a20d5","finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","line":212,"observation_digest":"107926e4a5413619968821c257b72b692000aac5eac8aa1f3af2df96d1e7524d","observation_id":"aro_v1_cb4snzffie3btfuiehbfpnzlne","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/context-extractors.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xsh6hg6f2qw3xxv5kn5o3bx3ca","reviewed_base_sha":"89011d8369d00ba0f6ddb49d850f73d1e864d96d","reviewed_head_sha":"7c6433acd522d08bcf1a28b6d7006a1cc394bcda","reviewer":"codex","start_line":210,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":955},"record_id":"art_v1_qz2sjlw2ibni5z5erhi6ziqin2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:33:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
